OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric hotel to be demolished   
OL,4,Afor Lidl store                         
OL,6,FA 19th Century hotel is set to be      
OL,7,Fdemolished to make way for a new Lidl  
OL,8,Fsupermarket.                           
OL,10,FPlans have been re-approved for the    
OL,11,Fstore to be built on the site of the   
OL,12,Fformer Goldthorn Hotel in Wolverhampton
OL,13,Fafter the original permission expired  
OL,14,Fin July.                               
OL,16,FThe planning committee at City of      
OL,17,FWolverhampton Council narrowly approved
OL,18,Fthe initial application back in 2023,  
OL,19,Fdespite 73 objections against the      
OL,20,Fplans, a 105-signature petition and a  
OL,21,Fformal objection from the Victorian    
OL,22,Fsociety.                               
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
