OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric hotel to be demolished   
OL,4,Afor Lidl store                         
OL,6,FThe planners at the time said the      
OL,7,Fsupermarket would create "significant  
OL,8,Finvestment and new jobs" and supported 
OL,9,Fthe new store.                         
